b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq X\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to \\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(\\langle b,a\\rangle\\notin R))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelWellFoundedRelation}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land \\forall A\\subseteq X\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\to \\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;(\\langle b,a\\rangle\\notin R))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (relation-on-carrier predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on.md]])","embed":false}],"math":